--TEST--
a declaration nobody documented answers `none` rather than an empty popup, and an ordinary `//` comment above it is not a run, `rule:tooling/doc-comment-is-three-slashes`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// Not a doc comment: two slashes, so nothing reads it.
class User
{
    public string $name = "";
}

var $u = new Us<|>er();
echo $u->name;
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
